      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assessment was able to provide a fairly good reasons for the potential causes of floods in Bentiu and what could be done about it. This has led to hiring of equipment from private (local) engineering companies by humanitarian organizations (IOM, UN Mission in South Sudan, etc.) to implement dyke reinforcement works. This is approach is expected to continue.</narrative>
